OL,3,GNEWSAPat Finucane a victim of          
OL,4,Astate-sponsored murder, inquiry hears  
OL,6,FPat Finucane was the victim of a UK    
OL,7,F"state-sponsored murder", a lawyer     
OL,8,Facting for the solicitor's family has  
OL,9,Ftold the public inquiry into the       
OL,10,Floyalist murder.                       
OL,12,FDanny Friedman KC told the inquiry it  
OL,13,Fmust answer "how far up the chain of   
OL,14,Fcommand" the killing went.             
OL,16,FThe 39-year-old solicitor was shot at  
OL,17,Fhis home in north Belfast by the Ulster
OL,18,FDefence Association (UDA) in front of  
OL,19,Fhis wife and children in February 1989.
